# Starter is credential-free and explicitly non-production.
# Profile selection belongs to kubernetes/application.yaml.
# Kubernetes context selection belongs to package.json applik8s.context or an
# explicit CLI --context argument; the ambient kubectl context is never used.

# Optional operation-host credentials for any application-owned provider whose
# installation selects credentialSource.kind: hostEnvironment. The Developer
# example does so by default; Dedicated may choose the same production deploy
# path. Values become Kubernetes Secret data and never enter the deployment
# graph, rendered TypeKro YAML, or Alchemy state.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
